								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zorlo65@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1219.msg12139#msg12139"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1219.msg12139#msg12139">Re: Rant all you want</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> October 28, 2004, 12:03:50 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Why would you get so freaked out over an argument... in the Rants and Raves section?<br /><br />Just because TFA adds a bit of humor to a section of the board that recieves no action isnt a crime. <br /><br />Here is what i saw:<br /><br />Xia: Let&#039;s not Insult eachother in the &quot;rants and raves&quot; section, because that wouldnt make sense. Fine whatever, but then: In your tos for the board you say you cant do that! Like, as if Kin&#039;s ToS for <i>his</i> site constitutes a legal contract? Jesus lighten up.<br /><br />Then Mal said something like: &quot;opens doors for legal issues&quot; Here is your airtight defense: Well, Your Honor, a person on forum section devoted to insulting other people, made fun of my alter ego, in a fantasy game, this is clearly unfair, because the legally binding contract that i checked the agree box on decrees that we cant be mean. Good luck with that, seriously.<br /><br />You are right though, for a second there i thought Rants and Raves meant a Kind Word.<br /><br />Zorlo
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
