							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1219.msg12139#msg12139">Quote from: Zorlo on October 28, 2004, 12:03:50 am</a></div><div class="quote">Why would you get so freaked out over an argument... in the Rants and Raves section?<br /><br />Just because TFA adds a bit of humor to a section of the board that recieves no action isnt a crime. <br /><br />Here is what i saw:<br /><br />Xia: Let&#039;s not Insult eachother in the &quot;rants and raves&quot; section, because that wouldnt make sense. Fine whatever, but then: In your tos for the board you say you cant do that! Like, as if Kin&#039;s ToS for <i>his</i> site constitutes a legal contract? Jesus lighten up.<br /><br />Then Mal said something like: &quot;opens doors for legal issues&quot; Here is your airtight defense: Well, Your Honor, a person on forum section devoted to insulting other people, made fun of my alter ego, in a fantasy game, this is clearly unfair, because the legally binding contract that i checked the agree box on decrees that we cant be mean. Good luck with that, seriously.<br /><br />You are right though, for a second there i thought Rants and Raves meant a Kind Word.<br /><br />Zorlo<br /></div><br />Who are you?&nbsp; I refuse to believe you people are so stupid that you believe Xia is actually being sincere.&nbsp; He&#039;s fucking mocking you retards.&nbsp; Doing a great job, obviously.&nbsp; Mal is just assing off laughing at you guys because the majority of this board buys posts like this as sincere when half the posts on this board since a few days ago are entire mockery.&nbsp; <br /><br />You just keep providing a larger base to work with.
