							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							With the influx of complete fucking retards we have had recently, mainly TFA, I didnt hesitate to think Xia might be sincere with his/her statement.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" /> 
