	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12211"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 18<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Officer of Tul Acharn<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1219.msg12211#msg12211"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1219.msg12211#msg12211">Re: Rant all you want</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> October 29, 2004, 02:50:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Look guys...<br /><br />TFA is your standard, vanilla board troll. He finds entertainment in getting members of a message board all &#039;riled up.&#039; Now, I&#039;m sure he&#039;ll reply saying how he&#039;s actually just posting or whatever to point out how stupid you, we, whoever are, but this is just more troll bait. A board troll will post statements that are so stupid, inflammatory and simply wrong that most people say to themselves, &quot;omg, that is so wrong...this guy is an asshole and I must post right away to tell him such!&quot; This is a mistake. You have been baited and now you are replying in the fashion they want. If your reply is weak, they&#039;ll pick it apart. If your reply is perfect, you&#039;ll just get called a retard.<br /><br />The solution is simple. Just ignore him. There is no redeeming value to his posts and the only thing you promote by replying is more flames and trolling.<br /><br />PS It&#039;s probably best to ignore the troll lackey...or wannabe, if you will, Zorlo as well.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
